"row_content":"<p>Yes. Ultimats are made using non-toxic, pet-safe materials and are suitable for everyday indoor use. They are designed to be low-odour and free from harmful emissions, ensuring a safe environment for your pets.<\/p><p>Additionally, by trapping dirt, dust, and debris at the entrance, they help keep your floors cleaner—creating a more hygienic space for pets to move around comfortably.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_GBXGW":{"type":"collapsible_row","disabled":false,"settings":{"paragraph-7ef6af4a73892bd282294fb9c626753b":null,"row_icon":"none","row_custom_icon":null,"title":"Can these be used indoors?","row_content":"<p>Yes. Ultimats are designed for indoor as well as covered entrance use. They feature non-slip backing, low-odour materials, and a refined surface finish, making them well-suited for homes, offices, and indoor commercial spaces.<\/p><p>By effectively trapping dirt and moisture at the entry point, they help keep interior floors cleaner and safer.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_PAMtp":{"type":"collapsible_row","disabled":false,"settings":{"paragraph-db8dc780b4fff1d9438ee3f33870d87a":null,"row_icon":"none","row_custom_icon":null,"title":"Are these washable?","row_content":"<p>Yes. Ultimats are designed for easy maintenance. Most mats can be vacuumed, brushed, or rinsed with water to remove accumulated dirt and debris.<\/p><p>For a deeper clean, they can be washed and air-dried, helping restore performance and keep them looking fresh over time.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_daXQK","collapsible_row_PH8nb","collapsible_row_GBXGW","collapsible_row_PAMtp"],"name":"t:sections.collapsible_content.presets.name"},"contact_form_tXTktH":{"type":"contact-form","disabled":false,"settings":{"heading":"need product support or a quote?","subtitle":"Our Customer Service Team Will Connect With You","show_email":false,"show_phone":false,"show_address":false,"custom_address":"","header-9ea16479a96b7e4912f17f201ca600c3":null,"show_